      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i started taking sertraline for my anxiety a few weeks ago but i just caught a nasty cold and have this really annoying cough that wont go away. is it okay if i take some of that generic cough syrup with dextromethorphan in it?? just want to know if there's any problem mixing them",
